  "description": "Vaporesso’s XROS Pro 2 takes the brand’s most popular pod kit series and gives it a smarter, lighter body and a bigger engine. The magnesium-alloy chassis keeps pocket weight to a minimum, while a 2000mAh battery and up to 30W output provide dependable day-to-day performance with fast USB-C 2A charging. A crisp 0.96” TFT screen shows power, battery and puff tracking at a glance and offers a choice of UI themes. With a couple of clicks you can lock the screen and fire button to prevent accidental presses when you’re on the move. Super Pulse technology keeps the vape steady from a full charge right down to low battery, so each puff feels consistent rather than fading away. The XROS Pro 2 works with the full XROS pod family and includes two 2ml COREX 3.0 mesh pods: a 0.4ohm pod pre-installed and a 0.6ohm spare. Both use simple top-fill under the mouthpiece and the latest COREX 3.0 heating (Hive Mesh) for quick, even coil response and stable flavour over time. The 0.4ohm pod delivers a warmer, airier inhale; it works with 50/50 e-liquids and can handle 70/30 High-VG for a looser RDL draw. The 0.6ohm pod pairs brilliantly with 50/50 or nicotine salts for a smooth, tactile MTL vape. Colours: Glittering Black, Glittering Gold, Glittering Silver, Storm Blue, Gem Green, Moonlit Pink, Dawn Purple. Explore our vape juice uk and discover a delicious companion for this kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. Vaporesso Xros Pro 2 Pod Vape Kit",
